<title>UK: LIFFE COFFEE LOSES GROUND, COCOA, SUGAR FIRM AM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE COFFEE LOSES GROUND, COCOA, SUGAR FIRM AM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Heads lower after weak open, but volume thin. Sept targets $1,600, down $24 at $1,606 by 0938 GMT.</p>
<p>COCOA - Marginally firmer in tight ranges. Dec most active but market quiet.</p>
<p>Sept up two at 1,024 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Very thin trade. Oct up 40 cents at $323.30.</p>
</text>
